# mobile/android/app/google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is
# Firebase *client* config: the same project id, app id and API key already
# committed in mobile/lib/core/config/firebase_options.dart, and shipped inside
# every published APK. The Google Services Gradle plugin reads that exact path,
# so ignoring it made a release build impossible from a clean clone — which is
# how it broke the first Build Android Release run. See docs/MOBILE_RELEASE.md.
# The real credential that must never be committed is the Admin SDK key, covered
# by firebase-service-account*.json above.
#
# GoogleService-Info.plist is the same category, kept ignored only because no
# iOS build exists yet; un-ignore it when one lands.
mobile/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

